  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8ab2da1d08f4fcb4380d1a1569c9ce14, type: 3}
  m_Name: ChatResponse_Sadness
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _classType: 100
  _list:
  - _responseId: 0
    _responseFI: "Eik\xF6 kukaan haluis pelaa mun kanssa? Tuntuu kurjalta istua t\xE4\xE4ll\xE4
      yksin\u2026"
    _responseEN: Doesn't anyone want to play this game with me? Feels bad to sit
      here alone...
  - _responseId: 1
    _responseFI: Voisin pelaa uudestaa, jos joku huolii mut
    _responseEN: I could play again if someones willing to take me
  - _responseId: 2
    _responseFI: "Voin tulla, jos siit\xE4 ei oo teille liikaa vaivaa"
    _responseEN: I can come, as long it doen't bother you guys too much
  - _responseId: 3
    _responseFI: Huoliiko joku mut, jos haluun pelaa?
    _responseEN: Is someone willing to play with the poor old me?
  - _responseId: 4
    _responseFI: Joo, vaikka.
    _responseEN: Yeah, I guess.
  - _responseId: 5
    _responseFI: Ei varmaan.
    _responseEN: Don't think so.
  - _responseId: 6
    _responseFI: "M\xE4 olisin nyt t\xE4\xE4l, jos ket\xE4\xE4 kiinnostaa"
    _responseEN: I'm here, if anyone cares.
  - _responseId: 7
    _responseFI: "Joo, t\xE4\xE4 oli nyt t\xE4ss\xE4 t\xE4lt\xE4 er\xE4\xE4"
    _responseEN: Yeah, I think that was that.
  - _responseId: 8
    _responseFI: "Poistun nyt, mut jos haluutte, voin tulla takasin sit my\xF6hemmin
      viel\xE4"
    _responseEN: I'll leave now, but if you want I guess I could come back later.
  - _responseId: 9
    _responseFI: "Kohta varmaa h\xE4vit\xE4\xE4n, ku ollaa voitettu ihan liikaa"
    _responseEN: We've been winning too much, the next one is quaranteed to be a
      loss.
  - _responseId: 10
    _responseFI: "Ei t\xE4\xE4 t\xE4st\xE4 kyll\xE4 en\xE4\xE4 parane. Me vaan h\xE4vit\xE4\xE4n
      kokoaika."
    _responseEN: There's no way this'll get better... We're just losing again and
      again.
  - _responseId: 11
    _responseFI: "Ois kiva n\xE4hd\xE4 teit\xE4 Discordissa, jos ket\xE4\xE4n kiinnostaa.
      Linkki l\xF6ytyis nettisivuilta."
    _responseEN: It could be nice to see you in Discord... if anyones interested.
      Links in the website.
  - _responseId: 12
    _responseFI: Kukaan ei haluu pelaa mun kanssa. Oon ihan yksin.
    _responseEN: Nobody wants to play with me... I'm all alone.
  - _responseId: 13
    _responseFI: "On t\xE4\xE4 ihan kiva peli"
    _responseEN: I guess this is a decent game.
  - _responseId: 14
    _responseFI: "Ei oo kyll\xE4 mulle t\xE4\xE4 peli, tuun t\xE4st\xE4 vaan surulliseks."
    _responseEN: Yeah... this ain't the game for me... it just makes me sad.
  - _responseId: 15
    _responseFI: "\xC4lk\xE4\xE4 vihatko mua, mut m\xE4 en osaa pelaa"
    _responseEN: Don't hate me but I have no idea what I'm doing.
